flowchart TD
    A[Event created in Volandoo UI] --> B[Organizer configures event:\nformula, parameters, categories, pilots]
    B --> C[Organizer clicks Sync / Update]
    C --> D["POST /events/sync\n(Event Config JSON)"]
    D --> E{Live Scoring validates config}
    E -- OK --> F[event_id active in Live Scoring]
    E -- Error --> G[Ack/Nack with error detail]
    G --> B

    F --> H[Organizer creates or edits manga for day X]
    H --> I["POST /events/eventid/mangas/sync\n(Manga Config JSON)"]
    I --> J{Live Scoring validates manga}
    J -- OK --> K[manga_id active, ready to receive points]
    J -- Error --> L[Ack/Nack with error detail]
    L --> H

    K --> M[Trackers send raw GPS to Volandoo\nfrom scheduled takeoff]
    M --> N[Live Tracking Loop\nevery 15 seconds - see sequence diagram]
    N --> O[Volandoo detects pilot landing\nstops sending that pilot's points]
    N --> P[Manga closed: all pilots landed\nor organizer ends the round]

    P --> Q{New manga same event?}
    Q -- Yes --> H
    Q -- No --> R[Event finished]
